{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-01",
  "title": "孤岛",
  "storyCode": "1-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0740a344122409c36a735279f10d462e1723ac7cc1693f7e97e4843d003c7ec8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第七关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "是我的错觉，还是天确实越来越暗了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "......我也希望是你的错觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "不过我们本来时间就不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "天灾云的形状比刚才黑压压的一片更加清晰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "啧，裸眼看着它慢慢在头上凝聚显形，可不是什么好兆头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "加上，下城区的每一条街道都可能埋伏着整合运动......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "不，这个说法太过保守了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "该说是，整合运动满满当当地挤在街上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "几乎每条街上都有暴徒在搞破坏，抢劫，焚毁交通工具和店铺......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "这帮家伙，是觉得天气太好，所以出来野餐集会吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "现在跑出来野餐，一定会遭到天灾的无情摧残。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "这说明大部分整合运动都是些被野蛮冲昏头脑的傻瓜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......噗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "他们不是真的要......野餐啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "我，我只是发个牢骚，不是那个意思......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "这不是个形容吗？难道说这是个包袱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "抱歉，总是在这种时候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "唔唔唔......没，没事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "反而是憋笑有点难受......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "唔，抱歉......明明是很紧要的时期，我却......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "没关系的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我们不是为了让大家都哭丧着脸才建立起罗德岛的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "罗德岛，本来就希望各位，都能绽放笑容。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "阿，阿米娅......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "没关系的，医生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "那我们，就去为侦查工作贡献一份力量吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "四点钟方向的敌人，我会安静地处理掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "只要他们体内的病变器官不是什么警报器或爆炸物就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "另一侧，游离于据点之外的大批整合运动，就交给我们吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "只要杂音够大，就没有人能分辨出里面究竟包含了什么声音。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "那么，各自行动起来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
